<html xmlns:x="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:excel"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>出题模板</title>
      <!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><x:ExcelWorkbook><x:ExcelWorksheets><x:ExcelWorksheet>
        <x:Name>题目模板</x:Name><x:WorksheetOptions><x:DisplayGridlines/></x:WorksheetOptions>
      </x:ExcelWorksheet></x:ExcelWorksheets></x:ExcelWorkbook></xml><![endif]-->
    </head><body>
    <h2 style="text-align:center">模拟题库 · 题目批量录入模板</h2>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#555;line-height:1.8">
      <b>填写说明：</b><br>
      ① <b>题型</b>填：单选题 / 多选题 / 判断题 / 填空题 / 简答题；<b>难度</b>填：简单 / 中等 / 困难（留空按「中等」处理）。<br>
      ② <b>重要程度</b>填 1~5：1 了解 · 2 一般 · 3 较重要 · 4 重要 · 5 核心（留空按 3 处理）。<br>
      ③ <b>答案</b>：单选题填字母（如 B）；多选题连填（如 ABD）；判断题填「对 / 错」；填空、简答题直接填文字答案。<br>
      ④ <b>选项列</b>：判断题、填空题、简答题留空即可；单选 / 多选题按 A~D 顺序填写（不足四项留空）。<br>
      ⑤ <b>知识点</b>填该题归属的知识点名称，可留空；<b>解析</b>建议填写，便于复习。
    </p>
    <table style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px"><tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">序号</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">题型</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">难度</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">知识点</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">重要程度</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">题干</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">选项A</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">选项B</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">选项C</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">选项D</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">答案</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#f0f0f0;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">解析</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">1</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">单选题</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">简单</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">示例知识点</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">3</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">空气中含量最多的气体是？</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">氧</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">氮</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">碳</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">氢</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">B</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">空气中氮气约占 78%</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">2</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">多选题</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">中等</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">示例知识点</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">4</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">下列属于可再生能源的是？</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">太阳能</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">风能</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">煤炭</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">水能</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">ABD</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">煤炭是不可再生能源</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">3</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">判断题</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">简单</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">示例知识点</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">2</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">空气中氧气含量高于氮气。</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">错</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">氮气约 78%，氧气约 21%</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">4</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">填空题</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">中等</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">示例知识点</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">3</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">水的化学式是____。</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">H₂O</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">两个氢原子、一个氧原子</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">5</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">简答题</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">困难</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">示例知识点</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">5</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">简述光合作用的意义。</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA"></td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#FAEEDA">（此处填写参考答案文字）</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;background:#FAEEDA">把光能转化为化学能，维持大气氧气含量</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center">6</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top">&nbsp;</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top">&nbsp;</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top">&nbsp;</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top">&nbsp;</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertica